--------------------+-------
 cte_any            |     3
 join_count_max     |     1
 query_over_1h      |     3
 query_over_60s     |     4
 rollback           |     2
 rollback_long_xact |     1
 rows_processed     |    20
 select_star        |     1
 seqscan_big        |     1
 stmt_select        |    11
 streak_days        |     1
(11 rows)

